OL,4,BAntonelli leads Russell in Qatar first 
OL,5,Bpractice                               
OL,6,GWorld champion Kimi Antonelli headed   
OL,7,GMercedes team-mate George Russell in   
OL,8,Gfirst practice at the penultimate race 
OL,9,Gof the season in Qatar.                
OL,11,FThe 20-year-old Italian posted his     
OL,12,Ffastest time of 1:23.217 on the medium 
OL,13,Ftyre, while Russell's marker, 0.507    
OL,14,Fseconds adrift, was set on the soft    
OL,15,Fcompound.                              
OL,17,FRed Bull's Isack Hadjar finished       
OL,18,Fthird, more than six tenths back on    
OL,19,FAntonelli, with McLaren's Lando Norris 
OL,20,Fand Oscar Piastri fourth and fifth,    
OL,21,F0.850 and 0.860 seconds back.          
